{"4633090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Misa Online", "steam_appid": 4633090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633090/extras/395c9ab77c175695a980c5f156b529a2.poster.avif?t=1781455968\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633090/extras/395c9ab77c175695a980c5f156b529a2.webm?t=1781455968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633090/extras/395c9ab77c175695a980c5f156b529a2.mp4?t=1781455968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>From the Age of Legends, remnants known as Portal Stones covered in mysterious, undeciphered symbols—are now falling across the world. But these are no mere ancient relics…</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each impact tears open gateways to unknown realms. Through these portals, creatures emerge bringing not only themselves, but the laws, darkness, and chaos of their worlds. As time passes, the land begins to change, balance is shattered, and the world is dragged into an irreversible war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival is no longer a choice it is a necessity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every new portal brings a new threat, a new challenge, and secrets waiting to be uncovered. Gather your strength, shape your destiny, and forge your legend against the rising darkness.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633090/extras/b612a3c5767a5e79ee1568d6c541ca82.poster.avif?t=1781455968\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633090/extras/b612a3c5767a5e79ee1568d6c541ca82.webm?t=1781455968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633090/extras/b612a3c5767a5e79ee1568d6c541ca82.mp4?t=1781455968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Massive Worlds, Endless Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into expansive, richly detailed maps inhabited by hundreds of unique creatures. Each region offers its own story, atmosphere, and dangers delivering a truly immersive PvE experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633090/extras/cb27115c461616be2f6aaa929d99c359.poster.avif?t=1781455968\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633090/extras/cb27115c461616be2f6aaa929d99c359.webm?t=1781455968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633090/extras/cb27115c461616be2f6aaa929d99c359.mp4?t=1781455968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mysterious Portals, Infinite Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every portal opens the gateway to a new world. Conquer the hidden threats within, claim rare rewards, and uncover the truth behind the growing chaos.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633090/extras/ab43b76f001121787dee46bfa7daf2b1.poster.avif?t=1781455968\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633090/extras/ab43b76f001121787dee46bfa7daf2b1.webm?t=1781455968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633090/extras/ab43b76f001121787dee46bfa7daf2b1.mp4?t=1781455968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Darkness is rising. </strong><br><br><strong>Which side will you stand on?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633090/extras/395c9ab77c175695a980c5f156b529a2.poster.avif?t=1781455968\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633090/extras/395c9ab77c175695a980c5f156b529a2.webm?t=1781455968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633090/extras/395c9ab77c175695a980c5f156b529a2.mp4?t=1781455968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>From the Age of Legends, remnants known as Portal Stones covered in mysterious, undeciphered symbols—are now falling across the world. But these are no mere ancient relics…</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each impact tears open gateways to unknown realms. Through these portals, creatures emerge bringing not only themselves, but the laws, darkness, and chaos of their worlds. As time passes, the land begins to change, balance is shattered, and the world is dragged into an irreversible war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival is no longer a choice it is a necessity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every new portal brings a new threat, a new challenge, and secrets waiting to be uncovered. Gather your strength, shape your destiny, and forge your legend against the rising darkness.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/